eir jobs.\\n\\n'Extraordinary Attorney Woo' (2022)\\n\\nWoo Young-woo (played by Park Eun-bin) is a young law prodigy, who graduated from the best school at the top of her class ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.marieclaire.com/culture/a26895105/best-korean-dramas/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was previously married to Faye Grant and Marjorie Weinman.- Actress\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Writer\\n\\nMulti-hyphenate actor, producer, writer, and director Sarah Drew is best known for her role as Dr. April Kepner on the hit ABC series Grey's Anatomy and as Hannah Rogers in Warner Bros' Everwood ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/date/10-01/births\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grey's Anatomy superbly portrays the effect of losing patients and the importance of attending to one's physical and mental health. Characters in Grey's Anatomy and The Resident lose loved ones to COVID-19; in the latter, this loss is also tainted with the suspicion of ... \",\"title\":\"https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jama/fullarticle/2787497\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"71c70c563ae6bed3f8d77de20ff32c8cfb01ea8d6de4d4311e168216cf9aab16\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"39acc5ab7a58698b11209338c541dbdcb47189eec4b7cb650966bee18a8e4712\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy character married three times one child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges