rayburn's marriage.\\n* Mrs Podsnap – the mother of Georgiana Podsnap. Though she embodies the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Our_Mutual_Friend\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... A so-called \\\"smart\\\" house filled with cameras, mysteriously malfunctioning technology, and three girls who are nothing like the well-behaved children she first met. But despite the lies she told to get the job, she maintains her innocence – and warns that the real murderer is still at ... \",\"title\":\"https://reedsy.com/discovery/blog/epistolary-novels\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... Instead, it turns out she was faking her mental health issues in order to get away with the murders of her parents—which she did with the help of her sister, who is arrested in the murders.\\n\\nShe appeared on Law & Order Criminal Intent in 2009 (Season 10 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nbc.com/nbc-insider/celebrities-you-forgot-were-on-law-order-svu\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Come to his next party and meet his private \\\"collection\\\" of people who got away with murder. Poirot agrees, and finds that the party includes four supposed murderers, along with Superintendent Battle of Scotland Yard, Colonel Race (formerly of MI5), and the celebrated mystery novelist Ariadne Oliver (Mrs ... \",\"title\":\"https://teaandinksociety.com/agatha-christie-books-in-order/?srsltid=AfmBOorJQVfc6sYO3zxP5ymB2gGq8fGWwmu-GduZbwjWw_jDnZ4MRvqp\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_re