:\"d64\"},\"ref\":\"d64\",\"snippet\":\" ... Katie becomes pregnant just before Johnny dies and survives on her own until she agrees to marry Sergeant Michael McShane, a pipe-smoking local policeman-turned-politician.\\n\\nSissy Rommely is Katie's oldest sister and one of Francie's three aunts. Because of her parents' immigration and lack ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Tree_Grows_in_Brooklyn_(novel)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d92\"},\"ref\":\"d92\",\"snippet\":\" ... This time Montgomery's lance struck the king's helmet sending three splinters into his head, including one which pierced his eye and brain.\\n\\nSomehow, Henry maintained consciousness enough to pardon Montgomery. He also survived the procedures to remove the splinters and it was hoped that the worst ... \",\"title\":\"https://thehistoricalnovel.com/2021/11/02/everything-wrong-with-reign-season-1/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her daughter, Ezinma, is the only child to survive infancy (Ekwefi gave birth ten times) and mirrors Ekwefi's independent strength. Ezinma and Ekwefi have a special bond, reflected in the mutual love and respect that they show one another. Ekwefi leaves her first husband and marries Okonkwo ... \",\"title\":\"https://study.com/academy/lesson/ekwefi-in-things-fall-apart.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... The two developed a unique character of an innocent man-child who found himself in dramatic and hazardous circumstances with only providence and good luck making him come out on top. This character clicked with the public and Langdon enjoyed a streak of artistic and commercial successes using ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=1944&ref_=nm_pdt_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\" ... and her child, a boy whom she names Richard. Esther and Mr Woodcourt marry and live in a Yorkshire house which Jarndyce gives to them. The couple later raise two daughters.\\n\\nMany of the novel's subplots focus on minor characters. One such subplot is the hard life ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleak_House\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... one survived,\\n\\nTwo divorced and two beheaded\\n\\nAnother popular mnemonic device is:\\n\\nDivorced, beheaded, died;\\n\\nDivorced, beheaded, survived\\n\\nThis is respectively:\\n\\nKatherine of Aragon, Anne Boleyn, Jane Seymour\\n\\nAnne of Cleves, Katherine Howard, and Katherine Parr.\\n\\nHenry VIII's six wives\\n\\nKatherine of Aragon\\n\\n1485 - 1536\\n\\nMarried: 1509 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rmg.co.uk/stories/royal-history/who-were-henry-viiis-wives\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... According to the Las Vegas Sun, Pesci has been married three times. His most notable marriage was to actress-model Claudia Haro from 1988 to 1992. The couple welcomed a daughter named Tiffany in 1992.\\n\\nDaniel Stern as Marv Murchins\\n\\nDaniel Stern's character may not have succeeded ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue